  "description": "Conformance kit for an app hosting the AI platform's connector wire contract (Modulus.AI.Connector): a fake platform that signs envelopes and receives revocation signals, and a suite that checks every certification category (authentication, tenant isolation, manifest, deny paths, query injection, field security, batch authorization, extraction, revocation, no adapter-side caching) against a running host. Test-framework neutral.",
